        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.14054v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-15T17:24:52Z",
        "description": "Recursive (IIR) filters realized as cascaded second-order sections (biquads) offer both design generality and robustness against coefficient quantization. However, their inherent sample-to-sample feedback dependency poses a fundamental obstacle to parallel computation. This paper reformulates the bi",
        "title_cn": "通过块矩阵重构进行快速级联递归过滤"
      },
