        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.14029v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-07-15T16:57:42Z",
        "description": "Magnetic order in materials combining localized rare-earth moments with itinerant transition-metal sublattices generates internal fields whose lattice imprint is rarely accessed directly. In Gd pyrochlore ruthenate, we find that a single terahertz spectrum resolves an exchange-split Gd$^{3+}$ mode a",
